   "parameters": {
    "content": "## CommunityConnect: delivery report\n\nTwilio reports back here for every text and call (delivered, failed, answered, voicemail, no answer, how long they listened). It shows on the website under **History \u2192 Report**.\n\n1. In **Config (status)** paste your Twilio Auth Token (same as the other workflows).\n2. Open **Save Status (Supabase)** and pick your Supabase credential (same as in the voice workflow).\n3. Save, then **Publish**.\n\nNothing to set in Twilio: each text/call tells Twilio this address automatically.",
